Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:13.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,软软糯糯的 真可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:21.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊啊啊... 啊 啊 啊啊啊... 啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 你是怎么办到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你是... 蝶华
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了！我是圣蝶华！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:34.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,幸会...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次见面！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正式见面还是第一次 没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上次大展身手 我见到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.19,0:00:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白也跟我聊了不少！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说 鸟早上也会低血糖的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 等会再变一次鸟给我看看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多多关照！少年！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:59.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,少年... 是指我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:03.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:04.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.53,0:01:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好！今天大伙一起出去玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去山里！爬山！耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.47,0:01:13.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,爬山？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}气氛尴尬的两个人!? 阿翼与蝶华
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天涯海角能驰骋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小小小小小鸡仔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法定！时速要严守... （安全驾驶）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}（其实是OP的part2）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:05.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 坐着还舒服吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:07.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:10.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这究竟有多快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:12.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,树木和建筑一晃就过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:15.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是第一次坐车吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:19.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！在蓝天大地都是鸟族承担交通的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:19.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1125,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乘大鸟是很有趣 我的小鸡仔也是既快又可爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:28.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为什么要去山里？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？偶尔也要一起出个远门吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.91,0:03:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 我也想认识认识你！少年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,别再叫我“少年”了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！看到了！天晴山！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,人还不少呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:57.56,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？小空！小空！小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:03:59.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,天晴山任务？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边解开晴吾郎的谜题 一边向山顶发起挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:09.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,解谜登山吗！挺有意思的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.65,0:04:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面说了“解开全部的谜题 就能得到非卖品礼物”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:16.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,晴吾郎是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:19.06,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:21.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空很喜欢晴吾郎吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:23.35,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是很像少年啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:27.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,才不像！哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.93,0:04:32.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧！大伙就为了小空 解开谜题吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:39.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:39.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fad(1000,0)}天晴山解谜挑战 有两条路线！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有两条路呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:48.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一条是修好的步道 可以轻松健步的悠闲路线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.75,0:04:51.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,另一条是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:56.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常值得一攀的路线！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.99,0:05:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 我来照顾小空就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走你喜欢的那条路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:05.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢小蝶姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 我们出发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:10.66,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:13.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 我们走！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:15.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？我也要走这条路吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.19,0:05:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.55,0:05:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 少年就跟我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:23.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}休闲路线 起点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:28.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情很好呢 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少年！背包重不重？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:38.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题！我是天空公主的骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.32,0:05:41.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这种重量 不在话下！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 背不动的话跟我说哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！是不是就是那个？谜题！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}解谜挑战！ 来自晴吾郎的挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:58.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,前方有着 狸健狸狸狸身狸挑狸狸狸战狸的说！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:00.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这都什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:02.36,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:04.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是要换尿布了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:08.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到休息室了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:12.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 那就麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:19.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这动物好像是提示
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:22.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在蓝天大地 从没见过类似的动物...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:26.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:32.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,前方有着 狸健狸狸狸身狸挑狸狸狸战狸的说！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:37.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,“狸”是不是太多了...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:44.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 我懂了！这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:47.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 舒服了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:52.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道答案了 ！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}是健身挑战！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(214,970)}{\fs50}athletic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}是健身挑战吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:02.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？你已经解出来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 在过来休息室的时候 有的灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有着狸猫的插图 把"狸"字给去掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是健身挑战了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.85,0:07:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 我也是能解出谜题的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:20.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,既然知道了 就早点说出来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 解谜过程也挺有趣的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:28.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛... 道理是有的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说着说着 快看... 下一个挑战来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过健身挑战 就能打开下一关的大门！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 少年！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:43.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:46.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呜呜 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:49.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:52.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呀... 呀呀呀呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fad(500,0)}终点！辛苦的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:08:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,89)}{\fs50\c&H7CACFF&\3c&HE9FCFF&\4c&HE9FCFF&}起点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:08:01.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,健身挑战... 可以不用挑战的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 走吧 下一关！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:08.89,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 小空也干劲十足啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！看到下一题了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么来着...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}晴吾郎的挑战！藏起来的美丽是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“藏起来的美丽是什么？”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是说这里有藏着什么漂亮的东西吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}登山索道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索道...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们！去坐那个吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:49.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:54.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 那里就偏离路线了 解谜呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了！少年！快跟上！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我的！走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:06.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我受够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:10.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我去那边找！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:11.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟 我是不是被讨厌了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:26.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 差不多到交班时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？到点了？那就辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:35.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:49.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的... 这人怎么想什么就什么的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:50.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:51.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:55.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,两条路线画了个圆呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:59.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶和小空呢？你们不是一起走的...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:01.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:11.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点应付不来 那种强势的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:17.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶应该能够体会你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:20.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,她相信阿翼你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:22.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在上次保护小空的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:31.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼很生卡疤痛的气吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:36.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那次是.... 因为卡疤痛愚弄公主
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:39.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶也很生气的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:46.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,她的性格是有点强势 不过对小空的关心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:49.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼和小蝶都是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐... 可能是觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:57.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼的话 即使不通过语言 你也能够理解她的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:11.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:16.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,说不好 只要登上山顶 就能找到什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 要去山顶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:22.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油！少年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.00,0:11:55.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:05.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:20.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,彩虹...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:25.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是谜题的答案？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是只有从上方 才能看出来的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好美丽...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.18,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:41.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你是... 怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:44.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我会上来山顶...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我在缆车上看到你在奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:51.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跑得真快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:08.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道答案的话 就早点说出来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\fs50}入口 售票处
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:23.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:28.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！蝶华姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:30.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 试音试音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:34.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主我就收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:37.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便还抓到了龙套女B！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:39.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我并不需要她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:49.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:49.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,天籁接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:13:59.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.43,0:14:02.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.43,0:14:02.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:12.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,闪耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:12.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:20.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飞奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:20.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,畅快跃起！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:51.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高阔凌云的勇气！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:54.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:54.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飞翼愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:14:59.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:04.95,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:06.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:17.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:18.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.35,0:15:22.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:27.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不在乎小公主有什么三长两短的话 尽管打过来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:28.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:29.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,太卑鄙了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.34,0:15:34.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！带着小公主回来我这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:36.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴 乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:41.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:47.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它要真放开了 我们就危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我猜拳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:06.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜拳啊 会玩的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就告诉你吧... 我会出石头！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:13.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:15.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:17.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然大声宣言！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:20.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是个傻大姐啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:23.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！你出布
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么来吧！石头剪刀...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:30.27,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.65,0:16:34.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 吓死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:53.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是要脱身 也太乱来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈... 因为我觉得阿翼 应该能察觉我的作战计划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呢哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:08.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的！你们先躲到安全的地方去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:16.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:18.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:20.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:24.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴 乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:28.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}登山索道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:35.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:37.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:39.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
